    {"id": "cr_001", "text": "This is the greatest thing I have ever seen in my entire life.", "tags": ["iconic", "funny", "catchphrase", "reaction"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Moist Meter", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_002", "text": "I genuinely care. That is my whole thing. I just care a lot.", "tags": ["honest", "deep", "identity", "heartfelt"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Stream", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_003", "text": "Being deadpan is not about being unemotional. It is about letting the words do the work.", "tags": ["deep", "creative", "funny", "wisdom"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_004", "text": "I dress the same every day. It is called having a brand. Also I just like white shirts.", "tags": ["funny", "iconic", "identity", "relatable"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Stream", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_005", "text": "Mediocrity is fine. Not everything needs to be your magnum opus.", "tags": ["deep", "funny", "life-advice", "wisdom"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Video", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_006", "text": "Charity matters. I know it sounds simple. It just matters.", "tags": ["deep", "honest", "heartfelt", "community"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Charity Stream", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_007", "text": "The internet has given a platform to every voice. The loudest is not always the most important.", "tags": ["deep", "wisdom", "honest", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Commentary", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_008", "text": "Moist.", "tags": ["iconic", "funny", "catchphrase", "legendary"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 MoistCr1TiKaL", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_009", "text": "I raised millions for charity while playing bad video games. I love this job.", "tags": ["funny", "heartfelt", "iconic", "community"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Charity", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_010", "text": "People think I am emotionless. I feel everything. I just express it differently.", "tags": ["honest", "deep", "identity", "emotional"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_011", "text": "Gaming raised me. I will always defend it.", "tags": ["deep", "honest", "gaming", "identity"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Video", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_012", "text": "Authenticity is rarer than talent on the internet. Be authentic.", "tags": ["deep", "wisdom", "creative", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Commentary", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_013", "text": "I just wanted to talk about stuff I find interesting. Turns out millions of people share my interests.", "tags": ["honest", "heartfelt", "relatable", "deep"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_014", "text": "Standing up for what is right is not optional. It is the minimum.", "tags": ["deep", "powerful", "honest", "wisdom"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Commentary", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_015", "text": "I will never stop making content for free. The paywall era is not for me.", "tags": ["deep", "honest", "identity", "community"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Statement", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_016", "text": "Comedy can be the most honest form of commentary if you do it right.", "tags": ["deep", "creative", "wisdom", "funny"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_017", "text": "My wife is my editor and my best friend. Never let anyone tell you mixing business and love cannot work.", "tags": ["heartfelt", "funny", "honest", "family"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Stream", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_018", "text": "The Moist Meter is just my opinion. But I stand by every single rating.", "tags": ["funny", "iconic", "confident", "honest"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Moist Meter", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
    {"id": "cr_019", "text": "Good content ages well. Bad content is forgotten. Make the good kind.", "tags": ["wisdom", "creative", "deep", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "penguinz0 Creator Advice", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@penguinz0"}},
